{
  "_README": [
    "Strategy parameters. .env holds credentials and how to reach things; this",
    "holds what the bot DOES. One file, one source — editing it is the whole",
    "way to change a parameter.",
    "",
    "Why it exists: parameters used to live in .env AND as param_* rows in the",
    "database, and the database won. So SL_ATR_MULT=2.8 sat in .env while the",
    "bot traded 3.5, and editing .env looked like it worked and did nothing.",
    "Two of the four contradictions config_baseline reported were that split.",
    "",
    "Values here were taken from what was EFFECTIVE at migration, not from",
    ".env — where the two disagreed the database was winning, so the database's",
    "value is what the bot was actually running.",
    "",
    "The optimizer and the audit write HERE. Every change is recorded in",
    "config/parameters_history.jsonl with who changed it and why."
  ],
